;;;; -*- mode:lisp; coding:utf-8 -*-
;;;; command-names.sexp
;;;;
;;;; Enumerated catalogue of CAD command names from the ONLINE reference
;;;; documentation of AutoCAD 2026 (help.autodesk.com, 2026 ENU) and
;;;; BricsCAD V25 (help.bricsys.com), collected on 2026-09-14.
;;;;
;;;; This is the catalogue backbone for the autolisp-spec Commands chapter.
;;;; Names were harvested from the vendors' index/list data only (no
;;;; per-command detail pages were fetched).
;;;;
;;;; Sources / method:
;;;;   AutoCAD 2026 -- the "Commands & System Variables Reference" is served
;;;;   by the Autodesk CloudHelp (athena) search backend.  The complete
;;;;   command index was obtained by querying the CloudHelp search service
;;;;   filtered to contentType=Command:
;;;;     https://beehive.autodesk.com/community/service/rest/cloudhelp/resource/cloudhelpchannel/search/
;;;;       ?q=*&p=ACD&v=2026&l=ENU&source=CloudHelp&contentType=Command
;;;;   (paginated; 986 command topics -> 913 distinct names, incl. 76 titled
;;;;   "(Express Tool)").  Reference landing page:
;;;;     https://help.autodesk.com/view/ACD/2026/ENU/?guid=GUID-4FEBA606-95E0-4DC4-A116-257ED86DCD58
;;;;
;;;;   BricsCAD V25 -- command names harvested from the published Command
;;;;   Reference sitemaps (en-us locale, latest = V25):
;;;;     https://help.bricsys.com/static/sitemaps/result-sitemap.xml
;;;;     https://help.bricsys.com/static/sitemaps/bricscad-sitemap-_commandreference-1..7.xml
;;;;   (1270 command pages -> 1269 distinct names, incl. Express Tools).
;;;;   Command reference index:
;;;;     https://help.bricsys.com/en-us/document/command-reference?version=V25
;;;;
;;;; :availability -- :both | :autocad-only | :bricscad-only, per which
;;;;   vendor's reference lists the name.
;;;; :category -- a ROUGH single-keyword guess (to be refined later).
;;;; Leading-hyphen command-line variants (e.g. "-INSERT", "-LAYER") are
;;;; kept as separate entries where the vendor documents them separately.
;;;;

